ll},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-12-03T09:42:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T11:17:19Z","closed_at":"2025-12-03T11:16:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.1, 4.4.1\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19044) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.12033.1030) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X 16-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.98 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith an example such as this:\n\n```gdscript\nextends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\nclass_name TrainTranslationPlugin\n\nfunc _parse_file(path: String):\n    var res: DialogueLineContainer = load(path)\n    if not res: return\n\n    var msgids: Array[PackedStringArray] = []\n\n    var keys = res.lines.keys()\n    keys.sort_custom(func(a, b): return a.naturalnocasecmp_to(b) < 0)\n    for line_n in keys:\n        var line: DialogueLine = res.lines[line_n]\n        msgids.append(PackedStringArray([line.text, \"%s:%s\" % [path, line_n]]))\n    return msgids\n\nfunc _get_recognized_extensions() -> PackedStringArray:\n    return [\"tres\"]\n```\n\nI expect the translated file to contain lines for translation in the same order as they are in the `msgids` value returned. While some lines are ordered properly, many are not. As can be seen on the image, after line 6 comes line 24, then line 7.\n\n<img width=\"526\" height=\"277\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42c7b8c7-195c-4b6b-8e73-e38e3ccd6189\" />\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached project\n2. Open Project Settings > Localization > POT Generation\n3. Check the file \"DialogueLines/A1S1Redux.tres\" is selected\n4. Press \"Generate POT\" and choose a location\n5. Observe the editor log for the order the lines should be in\n6. Observe the generated file for the order they are actually in\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23902060/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"vaartis","id":14316128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE2MTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14316128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis","html_url":"https://github.com/vaartis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaartis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113491/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}